{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"898554","name":"METIS ULS","description":"With a stay at Metis, you'll be centrally located in Athens, just a 3-minute walk from Syntagma Square and 14 minutes by foot from Acropolis. This hotel is 0. 7 mi (1. 2 km) from Parthenon and 0. 6 mi (1 km) from Temple of Olympian Zeus. Make use of convenient amenities such as complimentary wireless Internet access, concierge services, and a television in a common area. Featured amenities include multilingual staff, luggage storage, and a safe deposit box at the front desk. At Metis, enjoy a satisfying meal at the restaurant. Cooked-to-order breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 10:00 AM for a fee. Make yourself at home in one of the 11 individually decorated guestrooms, featuring minibars and flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless Internet access is available to keep you connected. Private bathrooms with showers feature rainfall showerheads and hair dryers. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks.","address":"Diomeias 8","city":"Athina","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"105 63","lat":37.9764083,"lng":23.7317772,"giataCode":"1285253","phone":"+306938443481","email":"INFO@METIS-ATHENS.COM","website":"www.metis-athens.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/89/898554/898554a_hb_a_004.jpg?20250309021813","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/89/898554/898554a_hb_a_011.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/89/898554/898554a_hb_a_012.jpg?20250309021814","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/89/898554/898554a_hb_a_013.jpg?20250309021813","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/89/898554/898554a_hb_a_014.jpg?20250309021814","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/89/898554/898554a_hb_a_015.jpg?20250309021813",